me of the turning points. But I post one I am not sure why it did turn 25.\n\nLooking back I cannot see much\n\nFurther back I find something","a":"—","d":"","n":"#314","p":13,"im":["f5bbdf7d75d71b3a3be9db304007dd35970869ad","2294481da8c5c312c359e6ea5e71fc833b802342","e84c3fe03bf58722d3c324e7f4a400259c2afb0b","a69e51266e9b101aec45eee6d7dc888f807fe220","4e8f37e9224ad5e938ab1e811c1b8d75a4e9154b"],"m":314},{"id":"finddecision_p13_315","t":"haanz\n\nCan someone tell me where can I find the IF's youtube video on DP again? Thanks.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#315","p":13,"im":[],"m":315},{"id":"finddecision_p13_316","t":"haanz wrote: Can someone tell me where can I find the IF's youtube video on DP again? Thanks.\n\nHe deleted it and said he would DRM it than upload on RTM but didn't see it happening for past month. You can just wait...\n\nDengaima","a":"—","d":"","n":"#316","p":13,"im":[],"m":316},{"id":"finddecision_p13_317","t":"sev87\n\nso basically DP a place to look for price to turn\n\nis it right?","a":"—","d":"","n":"#317","p":13,"im":[],"m":317},{"id":"finddecision_p13_318","t":"Edge\n\nsev87 wrote: so basically DP a place to look for price to turn\n\nis it right?\n\nDecisions are everywhere on a chart. Once you undertake all the lessons you will see which decsions are the important ones. In terms of what you said, The emphasis ought to be placed on what caused the price to turn as opposed to price turning in isolation\n\n1373","a":"—","d":"","n":"#318","p":13,"im":[],"m":318},{"id":"finddecision_p13_319","t":"sev87\n\nEdge wrote:\n\nsev87 wrote: so basically DP a place to look for price to turn\n\nis it right?\n\nthanks edge for the reply.\n\ni think i need to learn alot about decision point, so many times i cant understand why price turn and what make that happen and find important DP","a":"—","d":"","n":"#319","p":13,"im":[],"m":319},{"id":"finddecision_p13_320","t":"sev87\n\ni have a question regarding DP.\n\nin this picture which one the DP? rectangle 1 or 2 or 3? ( in case theres a flag with 3 FTR like that )\n\nand another question ( bit off topic ), which flag is stronger? A or B? because i think point A looks like hold price but theres another pole and make another FL on point B, because theres so many case like this one and sometimes its just confusing to start mark the flag","a":"—","d":"","n":"#320","p":13,"im":["4e0d7e44bf583190925f39f7d566ed70897ccd21"],"m":320},{"id":"finddecision_p13_321","t":"Kavya","a":"—","d":"","n":"#321","p":13,"im":["4afc5a375d086eda389ba9b652d6d7eca2058490"],"m":321}],"images":[{"k":"943cf25cb3e69f54ec984572902d6f155d66e042","t":"assets/thumbs/943cf25cb3e69f54ec984572902d6f155d66e042.webp","f":"assets/images/943cf25cb3e69f54ec984572902d6f155d66e042.png","w":1500,"h":674,"b":114055,"o":"943cf25cb3e69f54ec984572902d6f155d66e042.png","p":13,"pid":"finddecision_p13_304"},{"k":"6350742f2dd2f8ba138cf9cc754f98c58633b66d","t":"assets/thumbs/6350742f2dd2f8ba138cf9cc754f98c58633b66d.webp","f":"assets/images/6350742f2dd2f8ba138cf9cc754f98c58633b66d.png","w":1500,"h":737,"b":97165,"o":"6350742f2dd2f8ba138cf9cc754f98c58633b66d.png","p":13,"pid":"finddecision_p13_305"},{"k":"27970cd309f7715bc47a39029ae5731d76cbecfc","t":"assets/thumbs/27970cd309f7715bc47a39029ae5731d76cbecfc.webp","f":"assets/images/27970cd309f7715bc47a39029ae5731d76cbecfc.png","w":1500,"h":737,"b":74479,"o":"27970cd309f7715bc47a39029ae5731d76cbecfc.png","p":13,"pid":"finddecision_p13_305"},{"k":"771fc48953c8802e54ec7292533e7dd523195ec1","t":"assets/thumbs/771fc48953c8802e54ec7292533e7dd523195ec1.webp","f":"assets/images/771fc48953c8802e54ec7292533e7dd523195ec1.png","w":1500,"h":737,"b":82789,"o":"771fc48953c8802e54ec7292533e7dd523195ec1.png","p":13,"pid":"finddecision_p13_305"},{"k":"c23d0e0d5f5b30d7c06ed834d0011b1d5288f605","t":"assets/thumbs/c23d0e0d5f5b30d7c06ed834d0011b1d5288f605.webp","f":"assets/images/c23d0e0d5f5b30d7c06ed834d0011b1d5288f605.png","w":1500,"h":737,"b":84296,"o":"c23d0e0d5f5b30d7c06ed834d0011b1d5288f605.png","p":13